                    71.0,
                    456.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The full principal sum, $25,000, is paid to the beneficiary if the employee dies. This amount is in addition to any amount payable under the Life Insurance Plan.",
            "block_bbox": [
                71,
                470,
