            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "\"Quadriplegia\" means the complete and irreversible paralysis of both upper and both lower limbs. \"Paraplegia\" means the complete and irreversible paralysis of both lower limbs. \"Hemiplegia\" means the complete and irreversible paralysis of the upper and lower limbs of the same side of the body. \"Loss\" of a limb means the loss of an entire arm or entire leg.",
            "block_bbox": [
